title: "Molecule Viewer and TTA pulse experiments"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based 3D molecule viewer with excited-state glow and scripted photophysics simulations, plus a Monte Carlo
  and master-equation simulation of triplet-triplet annihilation upconversion with live pulse-experiment and
  intensity-sweep apps.
